{"version":1,"content":"<p>Epic Games日前確認，旗下全新Epic Games Launcher已將SteamOS列入官方計劃支持的Linux發行版名單之中。這意味着運行SteamOS的Steam Deck掌機未來有望獲得更加完善的Epic遊戲平台支持，減少用户對第三方解決方案的依賴。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585426.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.672907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:13:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:23.915000+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"7f0c5c2747c43492dfb9a89eefc524d6ad484b4c9da133d3a4825c5e41b4ad63","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}